{start_of_verse}
I’ll deck my brow with roses the [F]loved ones may be [C]there
And [G7]gems that others gave me will shine within my [C]hair
And even those who know me will [F]think my heart in [C]light
[G7]Though my heart may break tomorrow, I’ll be all smiles [C]tonight
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
